# App colours

Use these colours in the Home Assistant Companion app and on screens that behave like an app. Lead with Primary blue and Accent teal, from the first screen to the controls.

The app palette has every primary colour, tint, shade and accent, plus two dark mode blues. Every value is the GOV.UK app palette, unchanged.

